# Address of the FastAPI backend that the browser calls.
# Leave it unset and the app uses port 8000 on the same host name you opened the
# page with (http://localhost:5173 -> http://localhost:8000). That pairing matters:
# the sign-in cookie is only sent when both use the same host name.
# To override it, copy this file to .env.local (which git ignores) and uncomment:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
